{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">OVR Input Method Bridge is a tool application that enables you to use your system input method editors(IMEs) to type non-English characters <i>in specific VR games</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This application needs to run by an account with admin permissions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Supported Games:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VRChat</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Supported IMES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simplified Chinese - Sogou IME\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Usage:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make the input field in the center of your view, turn on the keyboard(for quest and  knuckles controllers, the default binding of toggling keyboard is double clicking A button on the right controller), then you could switch your IME and type the characters.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3448100?t=1744902801","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3448100?t=1744902801","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448100/32557e1ecce6375654a508fe6d5d49cf15244d27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744902801","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448100/32557e1ecce6375654a508fe6d5d49cf15244d27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744902801","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">OVR Input Method Bridge is a tool application that enables you to use your system input method editors(IMEs) to type non-English characters <i>in specific VR games</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This application needs to run by an account with admin permissions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Supported Games:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VRChat</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Supported IMES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simplified Chinese - Sogou IME\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Usage:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ma